<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Institutional &amp; Macro Hybrid Gold Forecasting Terminal</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #070c17;
    --panel: #111b2e;
    --panel-alt: #0b1220;
    --border: #253652;
    --border-soft: #1b2840;
    --text: #f8fafc;
    --muted: #94a3b8;
    --gold: #f59e0b;
    --gold-bright: #fbbf24;
    --gold-dim: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.14);
    --blue: #38bdf8;
    --green: #10b981;
    --red: #ef4444;
    --purple: #a78bfa;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  .app-shell {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14px;
  }
  .top-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16233b 0%, #0b1220 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .brand-block h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .brand-block p {
    margin: 3px 0 0 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .pill-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .pill.gold {
    color: var(--gold-bright);
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
    background: var(--gold-dim);
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .card-title {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .key-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto auto;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .key-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  input[type="password"], input[type="text"], input[type="date"], select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #33486b;
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    outline: none;
  }
  input:focus, select:focus {
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }
  button {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.55;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .btn-gold {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #070c17;
  }
  .btn-slate {
    background: #273754;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .grid-3 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .grid-4 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .grid-4 {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .metric-box {
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
  }
  .metric-box.inst {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--purple);
  }
  .metric-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .metric-box.inst .metric-label {
    color: var(--purple);
  }
  .metric-val {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .metric-box.inst .metric-val {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .metric-sub {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .news-box {
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .news-box.national {
    border-left-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .news-head {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .news-box.national .news-head {
    color: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .news-body {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .forecast-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.45fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 660px) {
    .forecast-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .control-box {
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .field-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .price-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .price-panel {
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
  }
  .price-panel.highlight {
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
  }
  .price-panel-title {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .price-panel-main {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .price-panel.highlight .price-panel-main {
    font-size: 1.42rem;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .price-panel-sub {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .mc-card {
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: none;
  }
  .mc-title {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .mc-summary {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .scenario-item {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
  }
  .diag-panel {
    background: var(--panel-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .diag-log {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    max-height: 150px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .status-bar {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--blue);
    min-height: 18px;
  }
  .error-banner {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid var(--red);
    color: #fecaca;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    display: none;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }
  .pos {
    color: var(--green);
  }
  .neg {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .muted-note {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-shell">
  <header class="top-banner">
    <div class="brand-block">
      <h1>Hybrid Macro &amp; Institutional Gold Forecasting Terminal</h1>
      <p>Runtime Web Grounding + US Real Yields + COT/ETF Positioning + MCX-COMEX Parity + Correlated Monte Carlo</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pill-group">
      <span class="pill gold">24K INR / 10g</span>
      <span class="pill">Live Grounded Search</span>
      <span class="pill">Correlated Monte Carlo</span>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <span class="card-title">Browser Session &amp; API Key Vault (Local Storage Only)</span>
      <span class="muted-note" style="margin:0;">Never hardcoded in repository source</span>
    </div>
    <div class="key-row">
      <input type="password" id="apiKeyInput" placeholder="Paste your restricted Gemini API key here...">
      <button type="button" class="btn-slate" id="saveKeyBtn" onclick="handleSaveKey()">Save Key</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-outline" id="toggleMaskBtn" onclick="handleToggleMask()">Show</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-outline" id="clearKeyBtn" onclick="handleClearKey()">Clear</button>
    </div>
    <div class="muted-note">Restrict your Gemini API key in Google AI Studio / Cloud Console to your GitHub Pages domain (e.g. <code>[https://din13bagmare-star.github.io/](https://din13bagmare-star.github.io/)*</code>) and Gemini API only.</div>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <span class="card-title">Core Macro &amp; Geopolitical Telemetry</span>
      <span class="muted-note" id="telemetryStamp" style="margin:0;">Awaiting runtime fetch</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-label">1. Current International Rate</div><div class="metric-val" id="box1Val">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="box1Sub">Spot XAU / USD per troy oz</div></div>
      <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-label">2. Fed Lending Rate</div><div class="metric-val" id="box2Val">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="box2Sub">US Fed Funds &amp; 10Y Nominal Yield</div></div>
      <div class="metric-box"><div class="metric-label">3. Other Indicators</div><div class="metric-val" id="box3Val">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="box3Sub">USD/INR, DXY, Brent Crude &amp; FII</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <span class="card-title">Institutional Smart-Money &amp; Parity Signals</span>
      <span class="muted-note" style="margin:0;">Real Yields, Flows, Basis &amp; FX Attribution</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <div class="metric-box inst"><div class="metric-label">US 10Y Real Yield</div><div class="metric-val" id="instRealYield">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="instRealYieldSub">TIPS / Inflation-Adjusted</div></div>
      <div class="metric-box inst"><div class="metric-label">COT &amp; ETF Flows</div><div class="metric-val" id="instFlows">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="instFlowsSub">CFTC Managed Money &amp; ETFs</div></div>
      <div class="metric-box inst"><div class="metric-label">MCX-COMEX Basis</div><div class="metric-val" id="instBasis">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="instBasisSub">Duty + 3% GST + Local Spread</div></div>
      <div class="metric-box inst"><div class="metric-label">USD/INR Cushion</div><div class="metric-val" id="instCushion">--</div><div class="metric-sub" id="instCushionSub">FX vs. Global Gold Split</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="card-title">Geopolitical &amp; Domestic Event Impact Analysis</span><span class="muted-note" style="margin:0;">Global Shocks &amp; Indian Triggers</span></div>
    <div class="news-box"><div class="news-head">Global News &amp; Geopolitical Events Effect</div><div class="news-body" id="globalEffectText">Choose a target prediction date below and tap Run Hybrid Forecast to fetch live global headlines, geopolitical risks, central bank posture, and market pricing.</div></div>
    <div class="news-box national"><div class="news-head">National News &amp; India Domestic Effect</div><div class="news-body" id="nationalEffectText">USD/INR currency dynamics, RBI forex/liquidity actions, FII inflows/outflows, customs duty/GST rules, and Indian seasonal/wedding demand will appear here.</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="card-title">Target Date Forecast &amp; INR Parity Output</span><span class="muted-note" id="horizonBadge" style="margin:0;">Horizon: 1 to 90 days</span></div>
    <div class="forecast-split">
      <div class="control-box">
        <div><label class="field-label" for="targetDateInput">Target Date (INR 24K / 10g)</label><input type="date" id="targetDateInput" value="2026-12-12"></div>
        <div><label class="field-label" for="simPathsSelect">Monte Carlo Paths</label><select id="simPathsSelect"><option value="2000" selected>2,000 Correlated Paths</option><option value="5000">5,000 Correlated Paths</option><option value="1000">1,000 Correlated Paths</option></select></div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-gold" id="runForecastBtn" onclick="executeForecastPipeline()">Run Hybrid Forecast</button>
      </div>
      <div class="price-column">
        <div class="price-panel"><div class="price-panel-title">Int. Prices (Projected Spot on Target Date)</div><div class="price-panel-main" id="projIntPrice">--</div><div class="price-panel-sub" id="projIntSub">Global XAU / USD median projection</div></div>
        <div class="price-panel highlight"><div class="price-panel-title">Local Prices (India 24K per 10g)</div><div class="price-panel-main" id="projLocalPrice">--</div><div class="price-panel-sub" id="projLocalSub">Today: -- | Expected Change: --</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mc-card" id="mcResultCard">
      <div class="mc-title">Monte Carlo Distribution &amp; Multi-Scenario Tree</div>
      <div class="mc-summary" id="mcBandSummary">--</div>
      <div id="scenarioTreeContainer"></div>
      <div class="muted-note">Disclaimer: Probabilistic macro &amp; quantitative scenario modeling is for analytical reference only and does not constitute financial or investment advice.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="status-bar" id="statusLine"></div>
    <div class="error-banner" id="errorBanner"></div>
    <div class="diag-panel">
      <div class="card-header" style="margin-bottom:4px;padding-bottom:4px;"><span class="card-title" style="font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--muted);">Runtime Execution &amp; Model Discovery Log</span><button type="button" class="btn-outline" style="padding:4px 8px;font-size:0.72rem;" onclick="clearDiagnostics()">Clear Log</button></div>
      <div class="diag-log" id="diagLog">Ready. Save your Gemini API key above and select a target date.</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
<script>
(function () {
  "use strict";
  const STORAGE_KEY = "gold_terminal_gemini_api_key_v1";
  const TROY_OZ_TO_GRAMS = 31.1034768;
  const DEFAULT_GST_RATE = 0.03;
  const PREFERRED_SEARCH_MODELS = ["gemini-3.8-flash", "gemini-3.6-flash", "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "gemini-4-hydrogen", "gemini-4-argon"];
  function logDiag(msg) {
    const el = document.getElementById("diagLog");
    if (!el) return;
    const stamp = new Date().toISOString().slice(11, 19);
    el.textContent += (el.textContent ? "\n" : "") + "[" + stamp + "] " + msg;
    el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
  }
  function clearDiagnostics() { const el = document.getElementById("diagLog"); if (el) el.textContent = ""; }
  function setStatus(msg) { const el = document.getElementById("statusLine"); if (el) el.textContent = msg || ""; }
  function showError(msg) { const el = document.getElementById("errorBanner"); if (!el) return; el.style.display = "block"; el.textContent = msg || "Unknown error"; }
  function hideError() { const el = document.getElementById("errorBanner"); if (!el) return; el.style.display = "none"; el.textContent = ""; }
  function formatINR(val) { const n = Number(val); return Number.isFinite(n) ? "Rs." + Math.round(n).toLocaleString("en-IN") : "--"; }
  function formatUSD(val, decimals) { const n = Number(val); if (!Number.isFinite(n)) return "--"; const d = typeof decimals === "number" ? decimals : 2; return "$" + n.toLocaleString("en-US", { minimumFractionDigits: d, maximumFractionDigits: d }); }
  function isExcludedModelId(modelId) {
    const id = String(modelId || "").toLowerCase();
    if (!id) return true;
    return ["tts", "audio", "image", "imagen", "veo", "live", "transcribe", "embedding", "aqa"].some(function (tok) { return id.indexOf(tok) !== -1; });
  }
  function isCandidateSearchModel(modelId) {
    const id = String(modelId || "").toLowerCase();
    if (isExcludedModelId(id)) return false;
    return id.indexOf("gemini-3.8") !== -1 || id.indexOf("gemini-3.6") !== -1 || id.indexOf("gemini-3.5") !== -1 || id.indexOf("gemini-4") !== -1 || id.indexOf("gemini-3") !== -1;
  }
  function parseLooseJson(text) {
    const trimmed = String(text || "").replace(/^```json\s*/i, "").replace(/^```\s*/i, "").replace(/\s*```$/i, "").trim();
    try { return JSON.parse(trimmed); } catch (_) {
      const start = trimmed.indexOf("{"), end = trimmed.lastIndexOf("}");
      if (start !== -1 && end !== -1 && end > start) return JSON.parse(trimmed.slice(start, end + 1));
      throw new Error("Model output was not valid JSON:\n" + trimmed.slice(0, 600));
    }
  }

  function classifyMacroRegime(data) {
    const spotUsd = Number(data && data.spot_usd_oz);
    const spotFx = Number(data && data.spot_usd_inr);
    const corr = Number(data && data.gold_fx_corr);
    const regimeNotes = [];
    if (Number.isFinite(spotUsd) && spotUsd > 0) {
      regimeNotes.push("Spot Bullion Anchor: $" + spotUsd.toFixed(2) + "/oz");
    }
    if (Number.isFinite(spotFx) && spotFx > 0) {
      regimeNotes.push("USD/INR FX Anchor: Rs." + spotFx.toFixed(2));
    }
    if (Number.isFinite(corr)) {
      regimeNotes.push("Gold-FX Corr: " + corr.toFixed(2));
    }
    return regimeNotes.join(" | ");
  }

  function normalizeScenarioWeights(rawScenarios, fallbackUsd, fallbackFx) {
    const list = Array.isArray(rawScenarios) ? rawScenarios : [];
    const cleaned = [];
    let totalProb = 0;

    for (let i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {
      const item = list[i] || {};
      const prob = Math.max(0, Number(item.prob_pct) || 0);
      const tUsd = Number(item.target_usd_oz);
      const tFx = Number(item.target_usd_inr);
      cleaned.push({
        name: String(item.name || "Scenario " + (i + 1)),
        prob_pct: prob,
        target_usd_oz: Number.isFinite(tUsd) && tUsd > 0 ? tUsd : fallbackUsd,
        target_usd_inr: Number.isFinite(tFx) && tFx > 0 ? tFx : fallbackFx,
        drivers: String(item.drivers || "")
      });
      totalProb += prob;
    }

    if (cleaned.length === 0) {
      return [
        {
          name: "Base Case",
          prob_pct: 100,
          target_usd_oz: fallbackUsd,
          target_usd_inr: fallbackFx,
          drivers: "Baseline macro & currency trajectory"
        }
      ];
    }

    if (totalProb <= 0) {
      const equalProb = Math.round(100 / cleaned.length);
      return cleaned.map(function (sc, idx) {
        return {
          name: sc.name,
          prob_pct: idx === cleaned.length - 1 ? Math.max(0, 100 - equalProb * (cleaned.length - 1)) : equalProb,
          target_usd_oz: sc.target_usd_oz,
          target_usd_inr: sc.target_usd_inr,
          drivers: sc.drivers
        };
      });
    }

    return cleaned;
  }

  function createSeededRng(seedInt) {
    let state = (Number(seedInt) >>> 0) || 1337;
    return function () {
      state = (state + 0x6D2B79F5) >>> 0;
      let t = Math.imul(state ^ (state >>> 15), 1 | state);
      t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;
      return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;
    };
  }
  function sampleStandardNormal(rng) {
    let u1 = 0, u2 = 0;
    while (u1 <= 1e-12) u1 = rng();
    while (u2 <= 1e-12) u2 = rng();
    return Math.sqrt(-2.0 * Math.log(u1)) * Math.cos(2.0 * Math.PI * u2);
  }
  function computeLandedIndia24KPer10g(usdPerOz, usdInrRate, dutyDecimal, gstDecimal, basisInr) {
    const g = Number(usdPerOz), fx = Number(usdInrRate);
    const duty = Number.isFinite(Number(dutyDecimal)) ? Number(dutyDecimal) : 0.06;
    const gst = Number.isFinite(Number(gstDecimal)) ? Number(gstDecimal) : DEFAULT_GST_RATE;
    const basis = Number.isFinite(Number(basisInr)) ? Number(basisInr) : 1000;
    if (!Number.isFinite(g) || !Number.isFinite(fx) || g <= 0 || fx <= 0) return NaN;
    return ((g / TROY_OZ_TO_GRAMS) * 10.0 * fx) * (1.0 + duty) * (1.0 + gst) + basis;
  }
  function runCorrelatedMonteCarloEngine(cfg) {
    const spotUsd = Number(cfg.spotUsd), spotFx = Number(cfg.spotFx), todayInr = Number(cfg.todayInr);
    const horizonDays = Math.max(1, Math.min(90, Number(cfg.horizonDays) || 14));
    const dutyRate = Number.isFinite(Number(cfg.dutyRate)) ? Number(cfg.dutyRate) : 0.06;
    const gstRate = Number.isFinite(Number(cfg.gstRate)) ? Number(cfg.gstRate) : DEFAULT_GST_RATE;
    const basisInr = Number.isFinite(Number(cfg.basisInr)) ? Number(cfg.basisInr) : 1000;
    const pathCount = Math.max(500, Math.min(10000, Number(cfg.pathCount) || 2000));
    const scenarios = normalizeScenarioWeights(cfg.scenarios, spotUsd, spotFx);
    let weightSum = 0, weightedUsd = 0, weightedFx = 0;
    for (let i = 0; i < scenarios.length; i++) {
      const sc = scenarios[i] || {}, prob = Math.max(0, Number(sc.prob_pct) || 0);
      const tUsd = Number(sc.target_usd_oz), tFx = Number(sc.target_usd_inr);
      if (prob > 0 && Number.isFinite(tUsd) && tUsd > 0 && Number.isFinite(tFx) && tFx > 0) { weightSum += prob; weightedUsd += prob * tUsd; weightedFx += prob * tFx; }
    }
    const targetUsdMean = weightSum > 0 ? weightedUsd / weightSum : spotUsd;
    const targetFxMean = weightSum > 0 ? weightedFx / weightSum : spotFx;
    const dtYears = horizonDays / 365.0;
    const driftGold = Math.log(Math.max(1, targetUsdMean) / Math.max(1, spotUsd)) / dtYears;
    const driftFx = Math.log(Math.max(1, targetFxMean) / Math.max(1, spotFx)) / dtYears;
    const volGold = Math.max(0.08, Math.min(0.45, Number(cfg.annualGoldVol) || 0.16));
    const volFx = Math.max(0.02, Math.min(0.18, Number(cfg.annualFxVol) || 0.055));
    const rho = Math.max(-0.85, Math.min(0.85, Number(cfg.goldFxCorr) || -0.15));
    const rng = createSeededRng(Math.round(spotUsd * 100) + Math.round(spotFx * 100) + horizonDays * 97);
    const simUsdArr = new Array(pathCount), simInrArr = new Array(pathCount);
    for (let p = 0; p < pathCount; p++) {
      const z1 = sampleStandardNormal(rng), z2Indep = sampleStandardNormal(rng);
      const z2 = rho * z1 + Math.sqrt(Math.max(0, 1.0 - rho * rho)) * z2Indep;
      const sUsd = spotUsd * Math.exp((driftGold - 0.5 * volGold * volGold) * dtYears + volGold * Math.sqrt(dtYears) * z1);
      const sFx = spotFx * Math.exp((driftFx - 0.5 * volFx * volFx) * dtYears + volFx * Math.sqrt(dtYears) * z2);
      simUsdArr[p] = sUsd; simInrArr[p] = computeLandedIndia24KPer10g(sUsd, sFx, dutyRate, gstRate, basisInr);
    }
    simUsdArr.sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; }); simInrArr.sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; });
    const idxP10 = Math.min(pathCount - 1, Math.floor(pathCount * 0.10));
    const idxP50 = Math.min(pathCount - 1, Math.floor(pathCount * 0.50));
    const idxP90 = Math.min(pathCount - 1, Math.floor(pathCount * 0.90));
    const p50Usd = simUsdArr[idxP50], p10Inr = simInrArr[idxP10], p50Inr = simInrArr[idxP50], p90Inr = simInrArr[idxP90];
    const goldOnlyInr = computeLandedIndia24KPer10g(p50Usd, spotFx, dutyRate, gstRate, basisInr);
    return {
      expectedUsdOz: p50Usd, expectedInr10g: p50Inr, p10Inr10g: p10Inr, p90Inr10g: p90Inr,
      goldImpactInr: Number.isFinite(goldOnlyInr) && Number.isFinite(todayInr) ? goldOnlyInr - todayInr : 0,
      fxImpactInr: Number.isFinite(p50Inr) && Number.isFinite(goldOnlyInr) ? p50Inr - goldOnlyInr : 0,
      pathCount: pathCount
    };
  }
  async function discoverModels(apiKey) {
    const endpoint = "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models?key=" + encodeURIComponent(apiKey);
    const resp = await fetch(endpoint);
    if (!resp.ok) throw new Error("ListModels failed (" + resp.status + "): " + (await resp.text()));
    const payload = await resp.json(), models = Array.isArray(payload.models) ? payload.models : [], discovered = [];
    for (let i = 0; i < models.length; i++) {
      const m = models[i] || {}, methods = Array.isArray(m.supportedGenerationMethods) ? m.supportedGenerationMethods : [];
      if (methods.indexOf("generateContent") === -1) continue;
      const cleanId = String(m.name || "").replace(/^models\//, "");
      if (isCandidateSearchModel(cleanId) && discovered.indexOf(cleanId) === -1) discovered.push(cleanId);
    }
    return discovered;
  }
  async function invokeGroundedModel(apiKey, modelId, promptText) {
    const endpoint = "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/" + encodeURIComponent(modelId) + ":generateContent?key=" + encodeURIComponent(apiKey);
    const resp = await fetch(endpoint, {
      method: "POST", headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ role: "user", parts: [{ text: promptText }] }], tools: [{ google_search: {} }], generationConfig: { temperature: 0.15 } })
    });
    const rawText = await resp.text();
    if (!resp.ok) { const err = new Error("Model " + modelId + " HTTP " + resp.status + ": " + rawText); err.status = resp.status; throw err; }
    const data = JSON.parse(rawText), candidates = Array.isArray(data.candidates) ? data.candidates : [];
    const parts = candidates[0] && candidates[0].content && Array.isArray(candidates[0].content.parts) ? candidates[0].content.parts : [];
    const nonThoughtText = parts.filter(function (p) { return !p.thought && typeof p.text === "string"; }).map(function (p) { return p.text; }).join("").trim();
    const fallbackText = parts.map(function (p) { return typeof p.text === "string" ? p.text : ""; }).join("").trim();
    const combined = nonThoughtText || fallbackText;
    if (!combined) throw new Error("Model " + modelId + " returned empty text parts.");
    return parseLooseJson(combined);
  }
  function buildMarketPrompt(todayStr, istTimestamp, targetDateStr, horizonDays) {
    return [
      "Current date: " + todayStr + " (IST timestamp: " + istTimestamp + "). Target forecast date: " + targetDateStr + " (" + horizonDays + " days ahead).",
      "Use Google Search right now to fetch live real-time global & Indian market data and institutional signals:",
      "1) Live spot XAU/USD gold price per troy oz and live USD/INR exchange rate.",
      "2) Current US Federal Reserve lending rate (target range), FOMC rate expectations/odds, US 10-year nominal Treasury yield, and US 10-year TIPS real yield.",
      "3) US Dollar Index (DXY), Brent crude oil ($/bbl), and FII/FPI equity & debt flows in India.",
      "4) Institutional smart-money indicators: CFTC COT Managed Money positioning, SPDR GLD & Indian Gold ETF inflows/outflows, and central bank buying.",
      "5) Current Indian 24K gold price (INR per 10g), current Indian customs import duty rate as a decimal (e.g. 0.06 or 0.15), and MCX-COMEX local basis/spread in INR per 10g.",
      "6) Active global geopolitical events/conflicts/sanctions/risks affecting gold between today and " + targetDateStr + ".",
      "7) Indian national news/events (RBI MPC/forex actions, FII trends, wedding/festive season, customs duty/Budget context) affecting gold up to " + targetDateStr + ".",
      "8) Three scenarios (Base Case, Bullish/Dovish/Geopolitical Surge, Bearish/Hawkish/Strong-USD Case) summing to 100% with target_usd_oz and target_usd_inr on " + targetDateStr + ".",
      "Respond ONLY with JSON: {\"spot_usd_oz\": number, \"spot_usd_inr\": number, \"today_india_24k_10g\": number, \"fed_rate_text\": \"string\", \"fed_sub_text\": \"string\", \"other_ind_main\": \"string\", \"other_ind_sub\": \"string\", \"us_10y_real_yield\": \"string\", \"real_yield_signal\": \"string\", \"cot_etf_summary\": \"string\", \"cot_etf_sub\": \"string\", \"mcx_comex_basis_text\": \"string\", \"mcx_comex_basis_inr\": number, \"india_duty_decimal\": number, \"annual_gold_vol\": number, \"annual_fx_vol\": number, \"gold_fx_corr\": number, \"global_news_effect\": \"string\", \"national_news_effect\": \"string\", \"scenarios\": [{\"name\": \"string\", \"prob_pct\": number, \"target_usd_oz\": number, \"target_usd_inr\": number, \"drivers\": \"string\"}]}"
    ].join("\n");
  }
  function renderDashboard(data, mc, meta) {
